{"id":"fe3a2e8b1893c3da","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-schnorr-s-test.md","title":"Schnorr s 检验与 s 零类","display":"df-schnorr-s-test — Schnorr s 检验与 s 零类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-schnorr-s-test","aliases":["43-df-schnorr-s-test"],"display":"df-schnorr-s-test — Schnorr s 检验与 s 零类","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-computable-real]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 17.8.1; extension to rational s≥0 used in Proposition 17.8.4 and Definition 17.8.5","source_printed_pages":"533,535","source_pdf_pages":"553,555","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-schnorr-s-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-schnorr-s-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schnorr-s-test — Schnorr s 检验与 s 零类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 17.8.1; extension to rational s≥0 used in Proposition 17.8.4 and Definition 17.8.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"533,535"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"553,555"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 对串与元组使用本书有效编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>；柱集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a>。非负权重和在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,+\\infty]\">\\([0,+\\infty]\\)</span> 中求值。下式同时引入权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_s\">\\(w_s\\)</span>、检验谓词和零类谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_s(D)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\qquad(D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_s(D)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\qquad(D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(\\{(n,\\sigma):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\sigma\\in S_n\\})\\land\\exists w:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(w(n)=w_s(S_n)\\land w(n)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(w)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(\\{(n,\\sigma):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\sigma\\in S_n\\})\\land\\exists w:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(w(n)=w_s(S_n)\\land w(n)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(w)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}(s,\\mathcal X)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\land\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S_n}[\\sigma]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}(s,\\mathcal X)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\land\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S_n}[\\sigma]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>权重是串集合上的和，并非把重叠柱集当作可加的 s 维测度。定义中的一致可计算性约束整个 n 序列；有限实值函数 w 作为见证，避免把不合格候选 S 的无穷权重值交给有限实值可计算性接口。允许 s&gt;1 以使维数的取下确界集合非空；这与原文后续维数定义使用的参数范围一致。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 17.8.1; extension to rational s≥0 used in Proposition 17.8.4 and Definition 17.8.5，印刷页 533,535，PDF 页 553,555。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$，$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{CE}$ 对串与元组使用本书有效编码，见 [[43-df-ce]]；柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。非负权重和在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中求值。下式同时引入权重函数 $w_s$、检验谓词和零类谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$，$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{CE}$ 对串与元组使用本书有效编码，见 [[43-df-ce]]；柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。非负权重和在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中求值。下式同时引入权重函数 $w_s$、检验谓词和零类谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$，$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{CE}$ 对串与元组使用本书有效编码，见 [[43-df-ce]]；柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。非负权重和在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中求值。下式同时引入权重函数 $w_s$、检验谓词和零类谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"S=(S_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}","display":false},{"tex":"[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"w_s","display":false},{"tex":"w_s(D)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\qquad(D\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\iff\\operatorname{CE}(\\{(n,\\sigma):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\sigma\\in S_n\\})\\land\\exists w:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(w(n)=w_s(S_n)\\land w(n)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(w)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}(s,\\mathcal X)\\iff\\exists S\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SchnorrSTest}(s,S)\\land\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S_n}[\\sigma]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2474,"backlinks":[{"id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)$。$\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]；$\\operatorname{Martingale}$、$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]。上下极限在扩展非负实数中取值，$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$。"},{"id":"a89886